{"id": "47207", "title": "南方浮华", "author": "王跃", "category": "都市言情", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47207.htm", "intro": "这里不愧是世间的一个妙处：物产丰富，气候温和湿润，美景使人目不暇接，美食使人大快朵颐，美女使人眼花缭乱。这里生活的人们悠闲而又浪漫。这是一座浮华之都，一座浪漫之都；这里纸醉金迷，一掷千金；这里物欲横流，名利双收。这是一座以空前的速度膨胀的城市，良田千顷，顷刻就变成水泥丛林；小桥流水，旋即被摩天大厦取代；淳朴的民风荡然无存。", "base": "files/article/html/47/47207", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "1、女人是一部天书", "file": "6395430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2、男人是花心萝卜", "file": "6395431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3、一个有野心的女人", "file": "6395432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4、韩国爱情肥皂剧", "file": "6395433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5、乐天派", "file": "6395434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6、贫穷的父母", "file": "6395435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7、你娘得了脏病！", "file": "6395436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8、火车上的奇遇", "file": "6395437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9、川菜的玄妙", "file": "6395438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10、走漏了风声", "file": "6395439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11、正宗土鸡", "file": "6395440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12、美女别墅", "file": "6395441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "13、老局长也有走神的时候", "file": "6395443.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14、见了靓姐都是饿慌了的狼", "file": "6395444.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15、救人", "file": "6395445.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16、两强之争", "file": "6395446.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17、能干的外交家", "file": "6395447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18、盛宴", "file": "6395448.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19、微服私访", "file": "6395449.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20、狂热", "file": "6395450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21、混世魔王", "file": "6395451.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22、没有王法了", "file": "6395452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23、浮华", "file": "6395453.html", "available": f